# The pets tab as a bookcase (C1 look A) with the herd: the cushion on top, a plank per rarity with
# a mound that grows with the count, a shelf opened, the room nearly full, full (a box waits, your
# pet squishes), and much later with a bigger room and a million commons.
from rich
view full
pets 150                         # real pets: plain ones fold into the herd past 20 a shelf
herd common normal 190
herd common shiny 48
herd uncommon normal 50
herd uncommon shiny 17
herd rare normal 10
herd rare shiny 6
herd epic normal 5
fav 2
tab collection
wait 1
expect fits
shot near
shelf rare
wait 1
click MiniCard#2
expect fits
shot shelf
click "‹ shelves"
wait 0.5
expect text "pets"
# full: the room is exactly full, a box waits on the pile, your pet squishes
fill-room
give-box starter 3
tab boxes
wait 1
click "open 1"
wait 0.5
expect pile starter 3
wait text "squish*"
tab collection
wait 1
expect fits
shot full
click RoomPill#1
wait 0.5
expect text "our house"
expect fits
shot room_card
click RoomPill#1
# short on coins: the price stays tappable and your pet says so
room 1
coins 0
click RoomPill#1
wait 0.5
click "900"
wait text "more room costs*"
expect fits
shot room_poor
click RoomPill#1
room 0
# your pet on the box job with a full room: the boxes still show on the pile
unlock tab:automation
unlock feature:packs
teach boxes
task boxes
tab automation
wait 1
expect text "squish! 3 boxes on your pile"
expect fits
shot auto_full
tab collection
wait 1
coins 1000000
# later: a much bigger room, thousands on every shelf
room 12
herd common normal 46000
herd uncommon normal 12300
herd rare normal 3150
herd epic normal 380
herd legendary normal 30
wait 1
tab boxes
tab collection
wait 1
expect fits
shot later
# a million plain commons in the save and on screen
room 22
herd common normal 1000000
tab boxes
tab collection
wait 1
expect fits
shot million
shelf common
wait 1
expect fits
shot million_shelf
tab errands
wait 1
expect fits
tab automation
expect fits
# pets from the herd can go on adventures too (stand-ins in the picker)
unlock feature:parties
unlock location:meadow
place meadow
wait 1
expect fits
shot picker
# room steps are priced in capsules: the open card's price follows the machine (x8 once it's fixed up)
tab collection
wait 1
room 1
click RoomPill#1
wait 0.5
expect text "900"
fix tape
fix oil
fix flap
wait 0.5
expect text "7,200"
expect fits
shot room_machine
